
## One important thing for a public repo

Since this will be **public**, I'd also add a `.gitignore` that excludes things such as:

```gitignore
# Secrets
.env
*.pem
*.key
credentials*
secrets*

# Runner configuration
.runner
.credentials
.credentials_rsaparams

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
